        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Textbook Page</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: #333;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    .page-container {\n        max-width: 800px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    p {\n        text-indent: 2em;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        text-align: justify;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .image-row {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-around;\n        align-items: flex-end;\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .image-item {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        background-color: #f5f5f5;\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        color: #888;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 10px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .caption {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    .main-caption {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #555;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .exercise-section {\n        border: 2px dashed #e0c4a8;\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        padding: 35px 20px 20px;\n        position: relative;\n        margin-top: 50px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .exercise-title {\n        background-color: #e0a976;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 5px 30px;\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -18px;\n        left: 40px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .exercise-question {\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .exercise-grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n        row-gap: 40px;\n        column-gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .figure-item {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .figure-placeholder {\n        width: 120px;\n        height: 90px;\n        background-color: #fafafa;\n        border: 1px solid #eee;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        color: #aaa;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 5px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .figure-caption {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #666;\n    }\n    .footer {\n        text-align: right;\n        margin-top: 40px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    .footer span {\n        margin-left: 20px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n    <p>还可以发现，斜钉一根木条的四边形木架的形状不会改变. 这是因为斜钉一根木条后，四边形变成两个三角形，由于三角形有稳定性，斜钉一根木条的窗框在未安装好之前也不会变形.</p>\n    <p>三角形的稳定性有广泛的应用，图 11.1-8 表示其中一些例子. 你能再举一些例子吗？</p>\n\n    <div class=\"image-row\">\n        <div class=\"image-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 120px;\">[Photo: Steel Bridge]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">钢架桥</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"image-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 160px;\">[Photo: Crane]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">起重机</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"main-caption\">图 11.1-8</div>\n\n    <p>四边形的不稳定性也有广泛的应用，图 11.1-9 表示其中一些例子.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"image-row\">\n        <div class=\"image-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 160px;\">[Photo: Wooden Expanding Rack]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">活动挂架</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"image-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 160px;\">[Photo: Metal Expanding Gate]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">伸缩门</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"main-caption\">图 11.1-9</div>\n\n    <div class=\"exercise-section\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-title\">练习</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-question\">下列图形中哪些具有稳定性？</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-grid\">\n            <div class=\"figure-item\">\n                <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[Diagram: Parallelogram with diagonal]</div>\n                <div class=\"figure-caption\">(1)</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"figure-item\">\n                <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[Diagram: Rectangle divided in half vertically]</div>\n                <div class=\"figure-caption\">(2)</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"figure-item\">\n                <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[Diagram: Pentagon with top triangle]</div>\n                <div class=\"figure-caption\">(3)</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"figure-item\">\n                <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[Diagram: Pentagon with inner triangle]</div>\n                <div class=\"figure-caption\">(4)</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"figure-item\">\n                <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[Diagram: Hexagon with diagonal]</div>\n                <div class=\"figure-caption\">(5)</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"figure-item\">\n                <div class=\"figure-placeholder\">[Diagram: Hexagon with intersecting diagonals]</div>\n                <div class=\"figure-caption\">(6)</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        第十一章 三角形 <span>7</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
